      "@type": "dcat:Dataset",
      "dct:title": "DCASE 2022 Challenge Task 2 Development Dataset",
      "dct:description": "Development dataset for unsupervised anomalous sound detection under domain shift. It contains single-channel ten-second normal and anomalous recordings for fan, gearbox, bearing, slide rail, ToyCar, ToyTrain, and valve machines, with official training and test organization and attribute tables.",
